      "title": "At a glance",
      "body": "Tôi đến từ Mỹ answers the traveler question \"I'm from the United States\" in friendly introductions and light local conversation. This is for light conversation after someone asks where you are from. Its job is giving the other person a simple anchor rather than a long explanation. Expect a short reply, a smile, a time, or a light follow-up question; then use Explore next if the reply creates another small task.",
